#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_treasury_dashboard_l10n_latam_check.field_account_treasury_config__rejected_check_journal_ids
msgid ""
"Odoo has no 'rejected' state for third-party checks: a check counts as "
"rejected because it sits in one of these journals. Rejected checks are shown"
" apart and never projected as a receipt."
msgstr ""
"Odoo no tiene un estado 'rechazado' para los cheques de terceros: un cheque "
"se considera rechazado porque está en uno de estos diarios. Los cheques "
"rechazados se muestran aparte y nunca se proyectan como cobro."

